      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773201482626,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Client:\n- Generate Nullifier = Hash(sk || \"Election-2026-Nullifier\")\n- Obtain merkleRoot from server\n- Generates a HTTP Req:\n{\nProof: pi,\nPublic: {\nNullifier: <Nullifier>,\nMerkle Root: <merkleRoot>,\nVote1: Enc(1),\nVote2: Enc(0),\nVote3: Enc(0), \n  }\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "CAsmZqYfFWU8Fc-m6-2IP",
      "originalText": "Client:\n- Generate Nullifier = Hash(sk || \"Election-2026-Nullifier\")\n- Obtain merkleRoot from server\n- Generates a HTTP Req:\n{\nProof: pi,\nPublic: {\nNullifier: <Nullifier>,\nMerkle Root: <merkleRoot>,\nVote1: Enc(1),\nVote2: Enc(0),\nVote3: Enc(0), \n  }\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
