      "seed": 314161568,
      "version": 304,
      "versionNonce": 602024384,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773201482626,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Client circuit consists of mainly 3\nlogics/constraints:\n1. Nullifier logic\nSimple `Nullifier === Hash(sk || \"Election-2026-\nNullifier\")`\n\n2. Merkle proof\n\n3. ZKRP to ensure vote is valid. Vote valid iff:\na. vote is either 0 or 1\nb. only 1 voter gets a vote",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "nB3nwwKJnz7N5BdiXBZMB",
      "originalText": "Client circuit consists of mainly 3 logics/constraints:\n1. Nullifier logic\nSimple `Nullifier === Hash(sk || \"Election-2026-Nullifier\")`\n\n2. Merkle proof\n\n3. ZKRP to ensure vote is valid. Vote valid iff:\na. vote is either 0 or 1\nb. only 1 voter gets a vote",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
